{"seq":1,"slug":"currency-exchange","title":"货币兑换与汇率管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/cross-border-payments/currency-exchange","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"货币兑换与汇率管理\">货币兑换与汇率管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境电商支付中，货币兑换是不可避免的环节。当消费者使用本币支付而商户以另一种货币结算时，汇率波动直接影响双方的实际成本。汇率管理涉及展示汇率选择、兑换时机控制、汇率锁定策略和外汇风险对冲，是跨境支付成本优化的核心。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[消费者下单] --&gt; B{币种匹配?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[直接结算]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[货币兑换]&#10;    D --&gt; E{兑换方式}&#10;    E --&gt; E1[DCC - 发卡行兑换]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[MCC - 商户侧兑换]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[收单行兑换]&#10;    E1 --&gt; F[消费者承担汇率]&#10;    E2 --&gt; G[商户承担汇率]&#10;    E3 --&gt; H[中间汇率]&#10;    F --&gt; I[资金结算]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TB\n    A[消费者下单] --&gt; B{币种匹配?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[直接结算]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[货币兑换]\n    D --&gt; E{兑换方式}\n    E --&gt; E1[DCC - 发卡行兑换]\n    E --&gt; E2[MCC - 商户侧兑换]\n    E --&gt; E3[收单行兑换]\n    E1 --&gt; F[消费者承担汇率]\n    E2 --&gt; G[商户承担汇率]\n    E3 --&gt; H[中间汇率]\n    F --&gt; I[资金结算]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兑换模式</th>\n<th>汇率来源</th>\n<th>承担方</th>\n<th>加价幅度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DCC（动态货币转换）</td>\n<td>支付网关/DCC提供商</td>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>2-4%</td>\n<td>消费者偏好本币</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MCC（多币种收单）</td>\n<td>商户定价</td>\n<td>商户</td>\n<td>0-1%</td>\n<td>多币种定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发卡行兑换</td>\n<td>卡组织/发卡行</td>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>1-3%</td>\n<td>默认行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收单行兑换</td>\n<td>收单行结算</td>\n<td>商户</td>\n<td>0.5-1.5%</td>\n<td>单币种商户</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"动态货币转换-dcc\">动态货币转换（DCC）</h2><p>DCC 允许消费者在支付时选择使用自己的本币而非商户的交易币种。例如，一位中国游客在美国网站购物时，DCC 可以让他在支付页面看到人民币价格而非美元价格。DCC 的汇率通常包含 2-4% 的加价，高于卡组织的默认汇率。</p>\n<p>从商户角度，提供 DCC 选项可以减少消费者因不确定最终金额而放弃购买的情况。但需要注意的是，DCC 的汇率加价如果过高会引起消费者不满，部分市场的监管要求必须在 DCC 页面同时展示两种币种的金额和汇率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DCCOffer {&#10;  originalAmount: number;&#10;  originalCurrency: string;&#10;  convertedAmount: number;&#10;  convertedCurrency: string;&#10;  exchangeRate: number;&#10;  markup: number;&#10;  rateSource: string;&#10;  rateTimestamp: number;&#10;  validUntil: number;&#10;  comparisonRate?: {&#10;    cardNetworkRate: number;&#10;    difference: string;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DCCConfig {&#10;  enabled: boolean;&#10;  supportedCurrencies: string[];&#10;  maxMarkup: number;&#10;  rateProvider: &#39;visa_dcc&#39; | &#39;mastercard_dcc&#39; | &#39;third_party&#39;;&#10;  displayOptions: {&#10;    showBothAmounts: boolean;&#10;    showMarkupPercentage: boolean;&#10;    showComparisonRate: boolean;&#10;    defaultSelection: &#39;original&#39; | &#39;converted&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  eligibility: {&#10;    minAmount: number;&#10;    excludedBINs: string[];&#10;    excludedCountries: string[];&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DCCOffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  originalAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  originalCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  convertedAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  convertedCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  exchangeRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  markup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rateSource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rateTimestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  validUntil</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  comparisonRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    cardNetworkRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    difference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DCCConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportedCurrencies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxMarkup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rateProvider</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'visa_dcc'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mastercard_dcc'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'third_party'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  displayOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    showBothAmounts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    showMarkupPercentage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    showComparisonRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    defaultSelection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'original'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'converted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eligibility</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    minAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    excludedBINs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    excludedCountries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DCC 要素</th>\n<th>最佳实践</th>\n<th>监管要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>汇率展示</td>\n<td>同时显示两种币种金额</td>\n<td>欧盟PSD2要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加价披露</td>\n<td>明确标注加价百分比</td>\n<td>部分地区强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择权</td>\n<td>消费者可选择原币支付</td>\n<td>全球通行要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率有效期</td>\n<td>标注汇率有效时间</td>\n<td>推荐最佳实践</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多币种定价与结算\">多币种定价与结算</h2><p>多币种收单（MCC/Multi-Currency Processing）让商户直接以消费者的本币定价和收款，消除了消费者端的汇率不确定性。商户承担汇率风险，但通常可以获得更优惠的批发汇率。</p>\n<p>实现多币种定价的技术方案：商品价格存储为基准币种（如美元），通过汇率 API 实时或定期转换为展示币种。价格更新频率取决于汇率波动性——主要货币对（EUR/USD、GBP/USD）可以每日更新，新兴市场货币（TRY、ARS）可能需要每小时更新。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MultiCurrencyPricing {&#10;  baseCurrency: string;&#10;  basePrice: number;&#10;  localPrices: {&#10;    currency: string;&#10;    amount: number;&#10;    exchangeRate: number;&#10;    rateUpdatedAt: number;&#10;    roundingRule: &#39;nearest&#39; | &#39;up&#39; | &#39;charm&#39;;&#10;    charmPrice?: number;&#10;  }[];&#10;  hedgingStrategy: {&#10;    type: &#39;forward&#39; | &#39;option&#39; | &#39;natural&#39; | &#39;none&#39;;&#10;    coveragePercentage: number;&#10;    tenor: string;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CurrencySettlement {&#10;  merchantCurrency: string;&#10;  settlementOptions: {&#10;    currency: string;&#10;    settlementCycle: string;&#10;    fxMarkup: number;&#10;    minimumPayout: number;&#10;  }[];&#10;  autoConvert: boolean;&#10;  holdCurrency: boolean;&#10;  fxRateType: &#39;spot&#39; | &#39;daily_fix&#39; | &#39;weekly_fix&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiCurrencyPricing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  baseCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  basePrice</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  localPrices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    exchangeRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rateUpdatedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    roundingRule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'nearest'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'up'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'charm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    charmPrice</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hedgingStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'forward'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'option'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'natural'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    coveragePercentage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tenor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CurrencySettlement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  merchantCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  settlementOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    settlementCycle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fxMarkup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    minimumPayout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  autoConvert</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  holdCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fxRateType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'spot'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'daily_fix'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'weekly_fix'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>价格心理学在多币种定价中很重要。直接汇率转换可能产生&quot;不友好&quot;的数字（如 $29.99 转换为 ¥217.43），需要应用本地化的价格尾数策略——中国市场偏好整数或 .9 结尾（¥218），美国市场偏好 .99 结尾。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定价策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时汇率转换</td>\n<td>基于即时汇率计算</td>\n<td>价格最准确</td>\n<td>频繁变动影响体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定汇率窗口</td>\n<td>每日/每周固定汇率</td>\n<td>价格稳定</td>\n<td>可能偏离市场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地化定价</td>\n<td>按市场独立设定价格</td>\n<td>最优用户体验</td>\n<td>管理复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率+缓冲</td>\n<td>汇率加固定缓冲</td>\n<td>覆盖波动风险</td>\n<td>价格略高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"外汇风险对冲\">外汇风险对冲</h2><p>跨境电商的外汇风险（FX Risk）来源于交易发生到资金结算之间的时间差。对于大型平台，即使 1% 的汇率波动也可能导致数百万美元的利润差异。对冲策略帮助商户将汇率风险控制在可预测范围内。</p>\n<p>远期合约（Forward Contract）是最基础的对冲工具，锁定未来特定日期的兑换汇率。商户根据销售预测确定未来需要兑换的金额，与银行签订远期合约。外汇期权（FX Option）提供更灵活的对冲——支付权利金后获得在特定汇率兑换的权利（但非义务），汇率有利时可放弃行权。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FXHedgingStrategy {&#10;  exposure: {&#10;    currency: string;&#10;    estimatedMonthlyVolume: number;&#10;    averageSettlementDelay: number;&#10;    historicalVolatility: number;&#10;  };&#10;  instruments: {&#10;    forward: {&#10;      coverageRatio: number;&#10;      tenor: &#39;1M&#39; | &#39;3M&#39; | &#39;6M&#39; | &#39;12M&#39;;&#10;      rollingSchedule: boolean;&#10;    };&#10;    option: {&#10;      type: &#39;put&#39; | &#39;call&#39; | &#39;collar&#39;;&#10;      strikeRate: number;&#10;      premium: number;&#10;      expiryDate: string;&#10;    };&#10;    naturalHedge: {&#10;      localProcurement: number;&#10;      localExpenses: number;&#10;      netExposure: number;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  monitoring: {&#10;    markToMarket: boolean;&#10;    rebalanceThreshold: number;&#10;    reportingFrequency: &#39;daily&#39; | &#39;weekly&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FXHedgingStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  exposure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    estimatedMonthlyVolume</span><span 